ing from live-work data, which short traps cannot reproduce."}, {"id": "handoff_deploy_cycle", "label": "Deploy Cycle (runtime -> digests -> lint -> installers)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Edits go only into runtime/ and adapters/core-body.md; then build-digests, lint, installers, and grep-verification of live copies \u2014 the repository is the source of truth."}, {"id": "handoff_marker_gate_removed", "label": "Marker Git Gate Removal Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Field data showed agents already performed evidence runs; the marker file confirmed nothing beyond the work and broke commits when forgotten. The check was real \u2014 the lock was the superfluous part. Removed everywhere, leftovers swept by installers."}, {"id": "handoff_trust_path_hardening", "label": "Trust-Path Hardening (Leaf-Safe Hooks Edit + audit-hooks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_budgets", "label": "Runtime Character Budgets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Core payload <=9500 escaped chars (harness silently truncates at 10000), contract <=3000 paired with the hook SOFT_CAP, playbooks <=6000 (implementing 6500, orchestration 7000), digests <=12000 (Antigravity silently truncates)."}], "edges": [{"source": "handoff_deploy_cycle", "target": "handoff", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "hando